# {{PROJECT_NAME}}

This application was created with Vellum's `cpp-component` template. It extends
the normal TypeScript application with one app-owned `level-meter` component
through the bounded `vellum.component-abi.v1` escape hatch.

```sh
vellum doctor --fix --require-target macos
vellum build --target macos
vellum test --scenario smoke --target macos
vellum run --target macos
```

`native/level-meter.cpp` is application code. It includes only the installed
component ABI header and must not include renderer, Skia, Dawn, scene, or Pulp
headers. Its declared browser behavior is the JSX fallback.
